Bunbun was one of the 14 cards added in '''Beta 7.6'''. While its ability has always allowed it to summon a single Bun (which was also added in Beta 7.6) with Magic, its stats were changed a couple times, partly due to changes to Bun itself, which can be found [[Bun/Previous_Versions|here]].
[[File:Bunbun (Beta 20.0).png|thumb|Beta 20.0]]
Starting as a 3/4 for 5G, '''Beta 14.0''' gave it +1 HP. This was reverted in '''Beta 20.0''', but reverted back in '''Beta 55.1. Beta 57.0''' followed it up with -1 ATK and Cost, leaving it at 2/5 for 4G.
[[File:Bunbun (Beta 55.1).png|thumb|232x232px|Beta 55.1]]

